  Parameters: %{"background_tasks" => [], "cwd" => "/Users/johndavenport/Documents/github/code_my_spec/.claude/worktrees/phx-new-generator", "effort" => %{"level" => "xhigh"}, "harness_id" => "6bc4851f-f735-4590-bb1c-c660619b4019", "hook_event_name" => "Stop", "last_assistant_message" => "**Auth isn't the problem — it's working right now, for both harnesses.**\n\nDirect evidence, just run:\n\n```\nPOST /mcp?harness=6bc4851f...  → full tools list\nPOST /mcp?harness=e5da634b...  → full tools list   ← their checkout\n```\n\nBoth authenticated, both returning all 83 tools. And `/health` reports `\"credential\":true`.\n\n**The inference that led them astray was reasonable but wrong.** `:4003` being authenticated doesn't tell you anything about `:4004` — they're separate processes with separate credentials. But `:4004` isn't failing to find one: `Config.credential/0` tries a signed-in user token first and falls back to the deploy key, which `just harness` exports out of `envs/.env`. It found one, which is why the channel is connected and MCP forwards successfully.\n\n**What they were actually hitting was addressing, not auth.** Their session was running the unaddressed plugin, so its MCP URL was `?dir=${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}` — and I removed `?dir=` handling entirely. That produces *\"This request does not say which working copy it is about\"*, which is what they quoted. Their hooks failed the same way. Now that their plugin is regenerated to `?harness=e5da634b`, that path works, as the call above shows.\n\n**The `/auth` 404 is real but separate** — and already filed as framework issue `f75febae`. The `not_authenticated` message names `/auth`; the actual page is `/app/auth`. So on the occasions a session genuinely is unauthenticated, the message sends you to a dead URL. Worth noting an already-open session also needs `/mcp` to reconnect after signing in, since the MCP connection caches its state.\n\nSo: nothing to fix in auth. They need to be on the regenerated plugin, which is in place and verified.", "permission_mode" => "auto", "prompt_id" => "751abd6e-6176-44a9-b30f-02a999f99e16", "session_crons" => [], "session_id" => "80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37", "stop_hook_active" => false, "transcript_path" => "/Users/johndavenport/.claude/projects/-Users-johndavenport-Documents-github-code-my-spec--claude-worktrees-phx-new-generator/80dcd471-007d-4438-8f86-f511c41e6e37.jsonl"}
